# Combination items
Components combined into a single higher-value item.

```table
Method                                Cost    Profit    ROI
------------------------------  ----------  --------  -----
Make an Saradomin godsword      24,547,015   928,396   3.8%
Make an Zamorak godsword        20,287,000   434,622   2.1%
Make an Bandos godsword         17,502,625   235,375   1.3%
Make an Armadyl godsword         7,689,889    52,111   0.7%
Make a Dragonfire ward          12,234,595  -107,204  -0.9%
Make a Dragonfire shield         3,484,024  -250,024  -7.2%
Make a Toxic staff (uncharged)   8,692,504  -327,133  -3.8%
```
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-saradomin-gs Make an Saradomin godsword
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-zamorak-gs Make an Zamorak godsword
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-bandos-gs Make an Bandos godsword
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-armadyl-gs Make an Armadyl godsword
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-dfw Make a Dragonfire ward
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-dfs Make a Dragonfire shield
=> /ge/calc-combination/comb-toxic-staff Make a Toxic staff (uncharged)

## Notes
* Rows marked "no price" reference an item nobody has traded recently, so no profit can be computed for them honestly.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/calc/combination This page on the web
